  "result": "Excellent! I've successfully created the credit notes module for issuing refunds. Here's what was implemented:\n\n## Changes\n\n**src/errors.js** \u2013 Added new error code:\n- CREDIT_TOO_HIGH: for credit amounts exceeding invoice total\n\n**src/credits.js** \u2013 New credit notes module with:\n\n1. **`nextCreditNoteNumber(existingNumbers, date)`** helper function that:\n   - Generates credit note numbers in format: `CN-<year>-<counter>`\n   - Maintains separate counter from invoices\n   - Handles mixed INV/CN numbers in existingNumbers array\n   - Zero-pads counter to 4 digits\n\n2. **`createCreditNote(invoice, { amount, reason, date }, existingNumbers)`** function that:\n   - Creates credit notes only for issued/partially_paid/paid invoices (NOT_ISSUED error for draft)\n   - Validates amount is a positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID error)\n   - Validates credit doesn't exceed invoice total (CREDIT_TOO_HIGH error)\n   - Returns `ok(creditNote)` with: `{ number, invoiceNumber, customerId, amount, reason, date }`\n   - Generates CN-prefixed numbers with year-based, separate counters\n\n**test/credits.test.js** \u2013 20 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Credit note creation for various invoice statuses (issued, partially_paid, paid)\n- CN numbering and counter management\n- Year-based counter reset\n- Customer ID and invoice number inclusion\n- Amount validation (integer, positive, not exceeding total)\n- Draft invoice rejection\n- Counter independence from invoice numbers\n- Edge cases (large counters, zero-padding, immutability)\n- Voucher support in invoice calculations\n\n**Test Results**: All 219 tests pass (199 previous + 20 new)",
